Table 3. Main terms of the IBRD Flexible Loan
Term | Current setting | Source
Interest rate | Reference rate (SOFR for USD) + variable spread | {{ay:World Bank Treasury (2020)|17|certain}}
Final maturity | Up to 35 years; up to 50 years for some projects | {{ay:World Bank (2014b)|18|inferred}}; {{ay:IBRD (2025)|19|certain}}
Average maturity | Up to 20 years | {{ay:World Bank (2014b)|18|inferred}}
Short Maturity Loan | 7-year final maturity, 20 bps spread discount | {{ay:World Bank Treasury (n.d.-b)|20|inferred}}
Front-end fee | 0.25% of the committed amount, charged once | {{ay:World Bank Treasury (n.d.-a)|16|inferred}}
Commitment fee | 0.25% a year on the undisbursed balance, from 60 days after signing | {{ay:World Bank Treasury (n.d.-a)|16|inferred}}
Note: Terms are reviewed annually and may change; figures are as at October 2026.
